    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d305-a11">

                <pb facs="0668" n="584" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg584"/>

                <head>I.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-01-12"><hi rendition="#small-caps">January</hi> 12,
                            1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>To-day I received of Lieut. Maus, U. S. Army— <list>
                        <item>Six (6) mules.</item>
                        <item>Four (4) <hi rendition="#italic">aparejos</hi>.</item>
                        <item>Two (2) saddles.</item>
                        <item>Six (6) blankets.</item>
                        <item>Eight (8) ropes.</item>
                        <item>Four (4) coronas.</item>
                        <item>Two (2) bridles.</item>
                        <item>Five (5) halters.</item>
                        <item>Two (2) mantos.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <closer><signed>SANTANA PEREZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>A true copy.</p>
                    <closer>——— ———,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Second Lieutenant, First
                            Infantry.</hi></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
